# Local development secrets for `vite dev`.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in. The app currently needs
# nothing here: Open Food Facts requires no API key, only a descriptive
# User-Agent, which is a plain var in wrangler.jsonc rather than a secret.
#
# This file exists so the seam is obvious when a real secret does arrive.
# Anything genuinely secret goes here for local use and via
# `npx wrangler secret put NAME` for deployed environments — never in
# wrangler.jsonc, which is committed.
